Step 1 :
--------
  Install clean OS, excluding drivers
  Make your own settings (Group Policy Settings) Then,
  CMD,
      C:\Windows\System32>%windir\system32\sysprep\sysprep.exe /audit /reboot

Step 2:
--------
  After restart go to control panal and delete privious user account Then,
  create and formate disk partition in intiate disk-1 type choose GPT style (option only available if you are in virtual machine)
  Win + R, sysprep.exe
    Choose Enter System Out Of Box Experience (OOBE)
    Check mark on generlise
    Shutdown

Step 3:
--------
  Step in to boot manu and intiate the bootable pendrive os (used for formate the PC)
  click on repair this pc > troubleshoot > cmd
    1.
      Check on which disk which files are containt using command
      for entering in to the disk command          - C:
      for looking containt in to that disk command - dir
      for going back command                       - X:
    2.
      dism /Capture-Image /ImageFile:E:\install.wim /CaptureDir:C:\ /Name:win10
      E            : Destination file
      C            : OS  installed drive (clone drive)
      install.wim  : you can change .wim to .esd whichever present in to ISO > sources > install.esd/install.wim  
    3.
      Exit

Step 4:
  Exit & Continue to Windows, Setup windows again. (every settings will be same as you left, expect windows settings)
  download ANYBEARN software,
  replace ISO > sources > install.wim/install.esd file to the one we have made.
  Download that ISO.

Note:
--------
    convert .wim file to .esd files are possible
    cmd - run as administration
      1. wim->esd
         dism /export-image /sourceimagefile:E:\sources\install.wim /sourceindex:1 /destinationimagefile:D:\install.esd/compress:max

      2. esd->wim
         dism /export-image /sourceimagefile:E:\sources\install.esd /sourceindex:1 /destinationimagefile:D:\install.wim/compress:max
      
